            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="22ae-1fb4-b388-d475" childName="Ultramarines" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6 Strategic Contingency" id="5fd9-d572-7187-ef29" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Ultramarines</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit is Activated, if it is an infantry unit, you may remove it from the battlefield. Then, it Heals D3+1. Then, Deploy this unit wholly within your deployment zone. Then, you may select a doctrine ability and this unit loses this relic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="22ae-1fb4-b388-d475" childName="Ultramarines" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5 Special Bolt Requisition" id="a370-badb-1f90-9bd6" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Ultramarines</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit is Activated, select one model in this unit equipped with a weapon with&apos;bolt&apos;in its name. Then, select one of the following weapons and change its Tp to be the same as that&apos;bolt&apos;weapon&apos;s Tp. Then, until the End step, the selected model gains that weapon:</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="22ae-1fb4-b388-d475" childName="Ultramarines" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4 Gauntlets of Ultramar (Fists)" id="d72c-a501-5e58-d62a" hidden="true" typeId="2dff-53d0-6d25-8c59" typeName="Weapon">
          <comment>Ultramarines</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Tp" typeId="6c1c-7d1d-c8b0-33ec">ML</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="13c5-f234-c120-afc3">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="459f-6890-e77f-b62f">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="571c-0471-2614-c57c">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="D" typeId="c2c0-3714-05e2-65a0">2D3+1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="d93f-70ee-72bc-5ef9">Breach</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="22ae-1fb4-b388-d475" childName="Ultramarines" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Helm of Varthion" id="ad21-4381-6942-20a8" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Ultramarines</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">While this unit is ready, after each of your End steps, if this was your first turn in a row, you may take another turn and you must select this unit to activate that turn. If you do, during that turn, for each attack made for this unit, that attack gains Critical Hits 6+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="22ae-1fb4-b388-d475" childName="Ultramarines" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Medicae Supply Line" id="a4cd-2dc6-5828-2d61" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Ultramarines</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit is Activated, you may draw a line from any point on the edge of your deployment zone to any point on the edge of the enemy deployment zone. Then roll D3+2, and any number of friendly units that line passes through Heal any amount of your choice, with the total amount they Heal not exceeding that roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="22ae-1fb4-b388-d475" childName="Ultramarines" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="1 Archangel&apos;s Shard" id="44b7-9236-0a97-eb37" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Blood Angels</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit is Activated, select one model in this unit. Until the End step, the selected model gains the following weapon:</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="e9e1-2a24-faf7-e76f" childName="Blood Angels" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Angel&apos;s Wings" id="7fd3-456a-3e0a-7c28" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Blood Angels</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">For each Move Roll made for this unit, add 1 D6 to that roll. If this unit has Fly, add 2 D6 to that roll instead. If it does not, this unit gains Fly.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="e9e1-2a24-faf7-e76f" childName="Blood Angels" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6 Sanguinor" id="80bb-973f-949f-a81f" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Blood Angels</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s last model reaches 0 Health, instead of dying and removing it from the battlefield, all remaining attacks targeting this unit fail. Then, it Heals 2+2D3 and each enemy unit within 6&quot; suffers D3+1 SW. This ability can only be used once per battle round, even if another unit gains this ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="e9e1-2a24-faf7-e76f" childName="Blood Angels" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Aureate Halo" id="b9fa-7100-7e7a-32b7" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Blood Angels</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">This unit gains Resilient 6+. After a visible enemy unit Activates, until the End step, for each attack that targets this unit, add 1 to Resilient Rolls made for this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="e9e1-2a24-faf7-e76f" childName="Blood Angels" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5 Red Grail" id="7815-2ac4-611c-d248" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Blood Angels</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit is Activated, it Heals 1. For each melee attack this unit makes, that attack gains Critical Hits 5+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="e9e1-2a24-faf7-e76f" childName="Blood Angels" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4 Hammer of Baal" id="71d5-ef19-9627-4419" hidden="true" typeId="2dff-53d0-6d25-8c59" typeName="Weapon">
          <comment>Blood Angels</comment>
          <characteristics>
