            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit has Assault Doctrine, each friendly unit within 16&quot; gains the following ability: Fenrys Hjølda!: For each melee attack this unit makes, that attack gains Critical Hits 6+.</characteristic>
