          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit has Tactical Doctrine and is within 2&quot; of and visible to another of your infantry units, this unit and other infantry units within 2&quot; of and visible to this unit gain the following ability:</characteristic>
