          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While enemy infantry units are visible to and within 24” of this unit, they gain the following ability:


Observed: For each ranged attack that targets this unit, if that unit has cover for that attack, a Hit Roll of 6 for that attack always wounds.</characteristic>
