                  <rules>
                    <rule name="*Haywire" id="c8e5-9656-c19a-d3e9" hidden="false">
                      <description>For each attack made for this weapon, if the target of that is a vehicle unit, improve this weapon’s S to 6 this turn. If that unit gains Suppressed X this turn, the target unit also gains Stunned.

Stunned: After this unit Activates, if it has Suppressed X, roll a D6. If the result of that roll is less than the X of Suppressed X, this unit becomes ready and skip this turns’ Move and Attacks steps. Then, this unit loses this ability.</description>
