          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Relentless Exuberance" id="7ac1-346d-531c-f75d" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each initiative roll you make, if one or more enemy units are visible to this unit, add 1 D6 to that roll and discard the lowest result. If you do, the next time you select a unit to activate, you must select any of your BLOOD CLAW S units.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Howling Charge" id="fd54-8b6b-5d16-db53" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit has Assault Doctrine, after this unit finishes an Advance within engagement range of any enemy units, all enemy units within 6&quot; of this unit suffers D3+1 Suppression.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
