          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While other friendly infantry units are within 1&quot; of this unit and this unit is closer or the same distance to an active enemy unit visible to this unit, those friendly infantry units gain the following ability:</characteristic>
